//@version=6
// ============================================================
// ZoneEngineV2_W08Runtime_Worker - W08 runtime orchestration worker
//
// Home of the W08 confirmed-5m pass orchestration (B15). It never imports the Main library and never sees the Main
// ZoneEngine: callers pass reference views (no array copy) of the Main storage it reads / writes - RootView,
// ParticipationView, PhaseSetView, WinnerView (W03 Candidate winners), ComponentMetaView (W06 /18 component dependency and
// semantic change metadata), the W08Core W08Store (with the nested CoreRegistryStore), the W08Core PendingTopologyStore pool,
// the W08Touch Merge / Split plans - bundled in ShadowContext, plus ShadowScalars (nextCoreId / nextGenerationId /
// nextRootId / coreRangeRevision in, shadow results out; the caller reflects them). Imports W08Core /18 and W08Touch /5
// only (no cycle). Storage primitives stay in W08Core (registry, origin / interval / inverse index, physical / Identity /
// Merge / Split / Pending / Changed planning) and W08Touch (ring, plans, ring apply).
//
// B15-B2 (/3): the Main dead W08 chain (30 helpers) is ported here path-only (engine.X -> the owning view, cfg.clusterMaxWidth
// / feed.mintick -> the context scalars, (engine, cfg, feed) -> ctx), keeping every condition, loop, comparator, ordering
// and sentinel; the Main copies stay as the legacy reference. Deliberate deltas: coreResetSlotRaw writes the 73
// Merge-deferred fields through coreDeferredStateRaw (same values), materializeAppliedRaw restricts the B07-D
// materialization to the applied Candidates (fresh IDs consumed only by applied fresh rows, F0-only mode, the range
// revision moved to the end of the pass), pendingStoreViewRaw returns the pass scratch pool, and coreFreeSlotRaw is split
// into coreFreePreflightRaw / coreFreeCommitRaw without the per-free global pending pool scan.
//
// Shadow pass (no production call site yet): planPass (the chain once on a scratch copy of the pending pool: physical ->
// Identity -> ownership -> Merge -> Split -> Merge Touch -> Split Touch -> Pending -> Changed), preflightPass (pass F0,
// read-only on the persistent state) and commitPass (only after a passed F0; a failing commit step is an invariant break,
// runtime.error). Apply set = the B14 changed components that are not pending (no old Side in ActiveTouch); a pending
// component only gets its B13 latest-state pending. Free set = EXPLICIT_MERGE_ABSORBED old Cores only (I27-11 / I27-12):
// not continued by an applied Candidate, every Merge-deferred state field at its reset default (MERGE_STATE_DEFAULT_GUARD),
// free preflight passed. A no-successor old Core is retained untouched (I27-10). Commit order: 1 pending replace, 2
// materialization (continuation re-install, fresh allocation, origin / inverse / participation / interval), 3 TouchMark ring
// replacement (B11 Merge plan / B12 SPLIT_LOCAL rows), 4 (index: in 2), 5 invalidation counts, 6 consumed READY pending
// clear, 7 absorbed free, 8 range revision.
//
// B15-B3 (/4): the committed pass also reports the W06 dependency carry (pass.dependencyChangedRootIds, rootId ASC, unique):
// the W06 L6 / L7 / L8 inputs of every Core are snapshotted before commit step 1 and after step 8 (live Core IDs, canonical
// bottom / top ticks, participation (coreId, rootId) pairs, PendingTopology Root node (coreId, rootId) pairs); a Core whose
// snapshot differs (alloc, free, tick range, participant set, pending Root set) contributes its old and new participation /
// origin / pending Roots, and (I27-14) the W06 L7 PC neighborhood [bottomTick - mTick, topTick + mTick] of its old range
// (free, tick change) and new range (alloc, tick change). Touch rows, Side state, revision counters, an exact float range change with equal ticks, a
// failed F0 (no commit) and a no-op pass give nothing. Nothing persistent is written for the carry here (the caller keeps it).
// ============================================================
library("ZoneEngineV2_W08Runtime_Worker", overlay = false)

// ==== TC-A (TOKEN_REFACTOR_ONLY): former W08Core /18 body, verbatim (call-0 functions dropped) ====

